    "description": "Clickable white-label wireframe for member profile setup after sign up.\n\n**Parent epic:** ROKJ-1 | **Stage:** Stage 1 | **Linked from:** ROKJ-3\n\n## Prototype links (run locally first)\n\n1. In the Rokjam repo: `npm install && npm run web`\n2. Open the **scenario tester**:\n\n    * http://localhost:8081/scenarios\n    \n3. Or use direct scenario links:\n\n| Scenario | Link |\n| --- | --- |\n| Scenario tester (recommended) | http://localhost:8081/scenarios |\n| Profile setup | http://localhost:8081/profile/setup |\n| Full new-user journey | Sign up → verify code → welcome → profile |\n\n**Mock test data:** username `thegoat` is taken; search \"Kangaroo\" for address suggestions.\n\n**Expo Go:** run `npm start`, scan QR code, open **Scenario tester** from welcome.\n\n**Out of scope:** Real persistence, branding/design system (ROKJ-5)",
    "customfield_10055": null,
